# "Empower Jace won't let you put loyalty counters on nontoken Jace planeswalkers" - only a Jace planeswalker token counts, so
# with Jace, the Mind Sculptor (3 loyalty as it enters) on the battlefield, Theorist's Proxy creates its own Jace token with 3
# counters and leaves the Mind Sculptor at 3 (CR 701.71a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Theorist's Proxy
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Proxy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
